// A request worker is not a second listener.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE worker ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law    ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG worker law

IMPULSE worker 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "worker" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
